Backgrounds are what your character was doing before they became an adventurer and they all give bonuses related to that task to your character.

Pick from the list below or roll a d20 and leave your character's profession in the hand's of fate (Its more fun this way)

List of Backgrounds:
1) Slave: Athletics / Knife, Broken Shackles / 1d4×10g
2) Soldier: Intimidate / Spear / 3d4×10g
3) Urchin: Acrobatics / Shortsword, Cloak / 1d4×10g
4) Thief: Sleight of Hand / Dagger, Rope / 2d4×10g
5) Outlaw: Lockpick / Handaxe, Lockpicking Kit / 2d4×10g
6) Craftsman: Craft / Hammer, Crafting Kit / 3d4×10g
7) Healer: Medicine / Medical Kit / 3d4×10g
8) Alchemist: Alchemy / Blowgun, Alchemy Kit / 2d4×10g
9) Beggar: Survival / Slingshot, Torch / 1d4×10g
10) Student: Lore / Writing Kit / 4d4×10g
11) Hunter: Perceive / Hunting Bow, Trap Kit / 1d4×10g
12) Watch: Investigate / Shortbow, Magnifying Glass / 2d4×10g
13) Traveler: Persuade / Javelin, 3 Packs of Rations / 3d4×10g
14) Swindler: Deceive / Knuckles, Set of Playing Cards / 3d4×10g
15) Outcast: Frighten / Club / 2d4×10g
16) Actor: Disguise / Disguise Kit / 3d4×10g
17) Entertainer: Perform / Whip, Any Instrument / 2d4×10g
18) Shepherd: Handle Animals / Quarterstaff, Dog (Companion) / 1d4×10g
19) Peasant: Insight / Sickle, Sling / 1d4×10g
20) Custom: Any Skill / One flavor and one weapon item from the starting list / 2d4×10g
